10. LIMITATIONS:-
1. This is a rule-based prediction system.
2. The weightage assigned to each criterion may not be applicable to all educational institutions.
3. The program depends on the accuracy of the information provided.
4. This program is only for demo/educational purposes.
5. It does not validate the input values. Negative percentage values will also be accepted.


